  "statement": "Find all ordered triples \\((x, y, z)\\) of positive reals such that \\(x+y+z=27\\) and \\(x^{2}+y^{2}+z^{2}-x y-y z-z x=0\\). Prove that your answer is correct.",
  "answerChoices": [],
