    {
      "id": "sol.hmmt-feb-team-2-2006-p12.hmmt",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "We have \\(x^{2}+y^{2}+z^{2}-x y-y z-z x=\\frac{(x-y)^{2}+(y-z)^{2}+(z-x)^{2}}{2}=0\\), which implies \\(x=y=z=\\frac{27}{3}=9\\).",
